Licensing scope for Better SMTC Bridge
=====================================

This project contains original SMTC Bridge material by nutty (nuttylmao)
and new contributions by Sveenet, plus separately licensed dependencies.

Original SMTC Bridge code and assets
-----------------------------------

Copyright remains with the original authors. The project owner has confirmed
private permission to modify and redistribute the original SMTC Bridge
material used in this project. That correspondence is not reproduced here.
The reviewed upstream repository provides no public license. This file does
not grant a sublicense or general reuse permission for the upstream code or
assets. Obtain applicable permission from the original rights holder before
reusing that material. See docs/provenance.md for its source and boundaries.

Original additions by Sveenet
-----------------------------

The following MIT terms apply only to the original additions identified in
docs/provenance.md. In files containing upstream material, these terms cover
only Sveenet's original contributions, never the pre-existing code or assets.
They do not override the original rights holder's terms or dependency licenses.

